  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PUM Programutveckling - utredning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme development and evaluation - November event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the final year, 2013, of the Strategy for Development Cooperation with Vietnam the Embassy assesses that there is a need to establish an internal Programme Development fund. The fund shall be used for smaller activities such as work shops, desk studies, seminars on results and reporting, proof reading etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under det sista &#xE5;ret, 2013, for samarbetsstrategin med Vietnam bed&#xF6;mer ambassaden att det finns ettt behov av att avs&#xE4;tta medel f&#xF6;r en intern programutvecklingsfond. Medlen ska anv&#xE4;ndas f&#xF6;r mindre aktiviteter s&#xE5;som work shops,desk studies, resultat- och  rapporteringsseminarier, revisionsgranskning etc.</narrative>
  </description>
